device register|list|show|rename|reconnect|audit|snapshot|restore|fetch|publish
Shared: --connection <local-file> --workspace-id <id>
audit: [--output <new-json-file>]
snapshot: [--output <new-directory>]
restore: --snapshot <directory> [--apply] [--prefer-source (first restore only)]
publish: --path <sync/devices/... or sync/profiles/...> (repeatable)
Restore transfers personal files only; extension installation and project transfer require separate verification.
